# ─── Generated mesh and solution files ──────────────────────
# These are large binary files produced by Ansys Fluent, or generated
# per-run OpenFOAM/CalculiX output (e.g. Stage 8's *_stage8.dat).
# They should NOT be committed — regenerate by re-running the pipeline.
*.msh
*.msh.h5
*.cas
*.cas.h5
*.dat
*.dat.h5
# Exception: tests/fixtures/**/*.dat are source-controlled test INPUTS
# (synthetic + real UIUC airfoil coordinate files the whole Stage 0/1
# test suite depends on), not generated output -- the whole point of
# committing them is a fresh clone can run the tests without
# regenerating/downloading anything. Found missing from git tracking
# entirely (2026-09-15) -- caught before it caused a broken fresh clone.
!tests/fixtures/**/*.dat

# ─── Airfoil coordinate files (downloaded by airfoil_downloader.py) ─────
# There are ~1600+ of these; download them on demand, don't commit.
data/raw/airfoils/

# ─── G2Aero database (downloaded/converted by g2aero_downloader.py) ─────
# curated_airfoils.npz is ~310MB; *.dat under airfoils_g2aero/ is already
# covered by the *.dat rule above, listed here for clarity.
data/raw/g2aero/
data/airfoils_g2aero/

# ─── Python bytecode ────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ─── Ansys Fluent Logs and Temporary Files ──────────────────
*.trn
cleanup-fluent-*.bat
fluent-*.log
*.h5

# ─── Test Outputs and JSON Logs ─────────────────────────────
e2e_test_out.*
test_out*.*
tmp_check.txt

# ─── IDE / OS ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# ─── Generated geometry and mesh directories ────────────────
data/geometry/
data/mesh/

# ─── Runtime logs and local session files ───────────────────
pyfluent_watchdog.err
session_transcript.txt

# ─── Claude Code local config ───────────────────────────────
.claude/

# ─── Orchestrator/investigation run output (real, kept on disk for
#     debugging -- large but cheap next to re-running real WSL/gmsh
#     solves; never git-add these) ─────────────────────────────
.orchestrator_runs/
.investigation_out/
.adversarial_probe/
.bl_direction_test/
.nonortho_test/

# ─── DeepONet training artifacts (regeneratable from .h5 data) ──
deeponet/checkpoints/
scripts/dashboard_data.json
scripts/dashboard_publish.html
